<title>USA: Forest Cove MUD, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>Forest Cove MUD, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $1.130 million of Forest Cove MUD, Texas, waterworks and sewer system combination tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.4391 percent.</p>
</text>
